{{Heroic_Card_Infobox|Cost=2|AbilityCost=1|Rarity=Common|Type=Troop|Arena=Goblin Stadium|ReleaseDate=February 2,2026}}{{Quote|A single gobble of Goblins is never enough! Hero Goblins are far too clever to go into battle without backup, so the final one to fall drops an unassuming banner that signals the second wave.}}
The Heroic Knight is a {{Rarity|Common}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 200 {{Icon|I=Hero Shard}}. It spawns four very fast, single-target, ground-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] with low hitpoints and low damage. The Goblins take the appearance of small, green creatures with pointy ears, green eyes, dark green eyebrows, amber sclerae, and a large peach nose, while carrying daggers and wearing team-colored suspenders and wristbands, along with brown pants and shoes. A Heroic Goblins card costs 2 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to deploy.

== '''Ability: Banner Brigade''' ==
{{Quote|The last Goblin standing drops a banner that calls in reinforcements.}}{{Hero Ability|1=Banner Brigade}}
The Hero Knight has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. The ability will be disabeld until the last goblin is killed. When the last goblin dies, a banner will be deployed that last 5sec. When the ability is pressed during that time, 2 Brigade Goblins will spawn a little behind. Brigade Goblins has the exact stats as the original goblins. The Banner Brigade ability costs 1 [[Elixir]] to activate.

== '''Strategy''' ==
*The ability can make it more difficult to spell them out, since they just can spawn again.
*If the banner is at the tower, it can act like a mini [[Goblin Barrel]]. Getting good damage for just 1 elixir.
*Dont press the ability, if the goblins will just die anyway.
