== History ==
2026

* Hero Goblins was released on 2/2/2026 with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|febuary 2026 update]], along with [[Mega Minion/Hero|Hero Mega Minion]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 23/2/2026, the [[Version History#2026 Q1 Update (23/2/2026)|2026 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased Banner Brigades spawned units to 3 (from 4){{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased banner duration to 5 seconds (from 7 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 7/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], the brigade goblins now spawn a tile back from where the banner is dropped at{{Balance|Neutral}}.
* On 6/7/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/7/2026)|Balance Update]], the deploy time for the brigade goblins increased to 1.3 seconds (from 1 second){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Hero Goblins' damage by 4%{{Balance|Buff}}, decreased the number of brigade goblins to 2 (from 3){{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased the deploy time for the brigade goblins to 1 second (from 1.3 seconds){{Balance|Buff}}.


